cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Executive Reporting Rollup
message: >-
  If you use this workflow or its documented n8n findings in your
  own work, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Orilla
    given-names: Leonielhou
    alias: itsleonforshort
repository-code: "https://github.com/itsleonforshort/executive-reporting-rollup"
abstract: >-
  An n8n workflow that replaces a weekly leadership deck built by
  hand. It reads five data sources, classifies each as read, empty
  or unreachable, calculates variance against target and
  week-over-week change, has an AI model write a short narrative,
  builds a Google Doc with two charts, exports a PDF, requires a
  human approval by Telegram before anything is sent, then emails
  leadership and records the week. Ships with the full build
  record, including a knowledge base of n8n behaviours proven by
  execution rather than taken from documentation.
keywords:
  - n8n
  - workflow-automation
  - ai-agents
  - business-intelligence
  - reporting
  - human-in-the-loop
license: MIT
